Z||000000||Banzai||08-15-2001||10:59 AM||||I just started a resto on my 84 2m4SE. I've got the drivetrain out. My motor and tranny are solid but the clutch went bad( the car sat for about 6 years in a polebarn before I bought it)Decided to give it the once over.<BR>Anyone got any solid advice to help smooth the project along???  What kind of underbody coatings have some of you used??? Anyone bought the Ocelot exaust?? Quality??   Any help would be greatly appreciated. Thanks <BR>Banzai !!!!!!!!!!||||reg||1
